WEBVTT

01:24.920 --> 01:28.720
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.320 --> 01:36.920
Before you bargain with me,
consider carefully

01:37.000 --> 01:39.240
what value you hold
and what leverage you have.

01:39.320 --> 01:40.800
I have no leverage.

01:42.280 --> 01:43.840
I'm merely a slave.

01:43.920 --> 01:46.200
As a noble master, you broke your promises

01:46.280 --> 01:47.760
and made things hard for a slave.

01:48.560 --> 01:49.720
What's your purpose?

01:50.800 --> 01:52.440
You really don't want me leaving the ship?

01:52.960 --> 01:55.440
What's wrong? Afraid of losing?

02:00.560 --> 02:01.400
What else?

02:04.040 --> 02:06.560
-I want off the ship.
-You're that desperate to leave?

02:08.280 --> 02:09.440
Getting off the ship is my chance.

02:13.920 --> 02:14.880
Fine.

02:16.800 --> 02:17.640
I'll allow it.

02:22.000 --> 02:23.680
-But the others?
-No, they cannot.

02:30.360 --> 02:33.600
Do you ever feel like
you've walked right into a trap?

02:34.480 --> 02:35.880
What trap could there be?

02:36.640 --> 02:38.800
If it works, the convoy profits.

02:39.320 --> 02:42.320
If it fails,
I'll get a chance to punish her.

02:42.840 --> 02:44.560
She was right.

02:44.640 --> 02:47.640
You, a noble master,
why bother with a slave?

02:47.720 --> 02:49.440
You think she's a slave, too?

02:49.520 --> 02:51.480
What kind of slave
defies her master daily?

02:51.560 --> 02:53.760
She just wants her mother's keepsake.

02:55.280 --> 02:58.680
-Since when have you gone soft?
-Haven't you noticed?

02:58.760 --> 03:00.600
She's like you were when you first
ventured into Black Dragon Cave,

03:01.120 --> 03:02.960
knowing nothing, helpless,

03:03.480 --> 03:06.320
just driven by sheer will,
and risking everything.

03:08.800 --> 03:10.040
That's why I was bloodied and beaten.

03:10.120 --> 03:12.720
Just like me, you also clawed your way
out of that pit.

03:13.320 --> 03:16.000
You know what
that blood-stained pearl represents.

03:27.640 --> 03:29.360
I asked you to tell Master Zhang

03:30.320 --> 03:33.880
if you were with me that day
or saw Cui Ding.

03:37.640 --> 03:38.640
I haven't seen Cui Ding.

04:06.960 --> 04:08.480
Duanwu, are you all right?

04:09.360 --> 04:10.840
I'm free to leave now.

04:12.320 --> 04:16.880
Then, are you going to sell that waste?

04:17.519 --> 04:20.519
Right now, I can only try my hand at it.

04:22.200 --> 04:23.280
Though…

04:25.120 --> 04:28.840
I still don't know how to get that waste.

04:30.520 --> 04:32.760
Eighteen cash a jin.

04:32.840 --> 04:37.840
Mr. Cao must have pocketed a nice cut.
He won't make it easy for us.

04:40.640 --> 04:43.080
What about Cao's superior, Assistant Pang?

04:44.400 --> 04:47.080
He manages sales.
He should have the authority, right?

04:47.160 --> 04:49.880
He's in cahoots with Mr. Cao,
not exactly trustworthy.

04:49.960 --> 04:52.480
Besides, we don't even know him,
and he's unlikely to trust us.

04:52.560 --> 04:54.280
There's one other person

04:54.800 --> 04:56.760
who truly cares about the convoy.

04:57.840 --> 04:59.640
But I don't know if she'd help.

05:01.000 --> 05:03.720
Duanwu, I can't hold it anymore.

05:25.840 --> 05:28.280
I, Duanwu, a lower-deck slave,
request to see Accountant Wei.

05:28.360 --> 05:31.440
-If it's an issue, go find Mr. Cao.
-This issue concerns the trading convoy.

05:31.520 --> 05:34.680
Reporting with overstepping
will lead to punishment.

05:34.760 --> 05:37.000
What if I suggest a potential oversight
in your accounts?

05:38.280 --> 05:40.360
Please hear me out first,
and then punish me as you will.

05:42.040 --> 05:42.880
Come in.

05:53.240 --> 05:56.800
-Greetings, Accountant Wei.
-Speak. What account?

06:01.240 --> 06:04.160
Accountant Wei,
this is waste from the trading convoy.

06:05.720 --> 06:08.480
Mr. Cao currently sells it
at 18 cash per jin.

06:09.200 --> 06:10.520
But look, Accountant Wei,

06:11.400 --> 06:14.240
within this waste,
if we extract all useful materials,

06:14.320 --> 06:15.440
then refine it further,

06:15.520 --> 06:18.720
it could be sold to herbal shops
and used for medicinal ingredients.

06:18.800 --> 06:20.840
Each batch could then earn two extra cash.

06:21.440 --> 06:24.480
-Twenty cash per jin?
-Correct. Twenty cash.

06:24.560 --> 06:26.480
A hundred jin only makes 2,000 cash.

06:27.000 --> 06:30.000
That's barely enough
for a day's meal for lower-deck slaves.

06:30.520 --> 06:31.640
So, you're giving me a number breakdown?

06:31.720 --> 06:34.080
But our convoy handles a lot of jewelry

06:34.160 --> 06:35.920
and thus, lots of waste.

06:37.800 --> 06:40.360
Accountant Wei, I've observed
the Master's shipments.

06:40.440 --> 06:42.760
Each transfer produces
over 200 jin of waste.

06:42.840 --> 06:46.840
Conservatively, at 20 cash per jin,
that gives us 4,000 cash.

06:46.920 --> 06:48.080
I've been with the convoy
for two weeks now,

06:48.160 --> 06:51.560
shipping at least three times already.
That amounts to 12,000 cash.

06:51.640 --> 06:52.800
Calculate it.

06:52.880 --> 06:55.120
Three times a month and 36 times a year.

06:55.200 --> 06:56.320
With 36 times,

06:56.400 --> 06:59.440
-it amounts to a total of--
-It's 144,000 cash annually.

06:59.520 --> 07:01.840
The convoy can easily handle 30 shipments.

07:02.640 --> 07:04.600
Our convoy's route from the West Regions
to the South Sea

07:04.680 --> 07:06.080
passes various ports.

07:06.160 --> 07:08.680
The Master purchases
and sells jewels each time.

07:10.560 --> 07:13.400
Recently, the Master held
the pearl auction,

07:14.080 --> 07:16.280
boosting our convoy's reputation.

07:16.800 --> 07:19.800
Given this, there'll be large shipments.

07:19.880 --> 07:21.120
You're sharp.

07:22.080 --> 07:24.400
Are you saying that I, Wei Yan,

07:24.480 --> 07:26.840
overlooked this profit under my own watch?

07:27.960 --> 07:28.800
Not at all.

07:30.280 --> 07:31.520
That's not my intention.

07:33.000 --> 07:35.840
The accounts handled by you
are all major accounts.

07:36.360 --> 07:37.200
This waste

07:37.280 --> 07:40.200
is only known to us lower-deck slaves,
working with it daily.

07:41.520 --> 07:45.080
Even adding just 140,000 cash annually,

07:45.160 --> 07:48.000
little by little, over time,

07:48.920 --> 07:52.160
it would accumulate significantly.
Isn't that right?

07:52.960 --> 07:55.040
So, what are you hoping for with this?

08:02.280 --> 08:04.160
I request permission from you

08:05.480 --> 08:06.520
to handle the waste sales.

08:15.040 --> 08:16.480
-Accountant Wei--
-She wants to sell the waste.

08:16.560 --> 08:18.160
You two can discuss it yourselves.

08:25.520 --> 08:26.920
Take a seat.

08:28.400 --> 08:29.680
Assistant Pang,

08:29.760 --> 08:31.680
I'm Duanwu, a slave from the lower deck.

08:33.559 --> 08:36.840
The Master has permitted me
to get off and sell waste when docked.

08:37.360 --> 08:38.360
From now on,

08:39.400 --> 08:40.520
I'll be relying on your help,
Assistant Pang.

08:41.360 --> 08:44.760
I see. No problem. It's just waste anyway.

08:44.840 --> 08:46.600
I recall

08:46.680 --> 08:50.600
Mr. Cao handled it
at 18 cash per jin before.

08:50.680 --> 08:53.040
Since you're under
Accountant Wei's guidance,

08:53.120 --> 08:54.160
let's make it 16 cash

08:54.240 --> 08:55.920
to help you open business.

08:57.440 --> 08:59.640
-Thank you, Assistant Pang.
-However,

09:00.280 --> 09:02.000
considering it's all waste,

09:02.520 --> 09:06.960
going back and forth is a hassle.
It's best to clear it all at once.

09:07.040 --> 09:08.680
-All at once?
-Yes.

09:08.760 --> 09:10.040
How much is there this time?

09:10.120 --> 09:11.720
About 200 jin, I believe.

09:13.280 --> 09:16.120
Alright. I see.

09:20.520 --> 09:22.640
Can this really make money?

09:22.720 --> 09:25.840
Duanwu, will the herbal shops buy it?

09:26.600 --> 09:29.000
I'm not sure, but I can give it a try.

09:29.080 --> 09:30.640
There's a full 200 jin here.

09:31.160 --> 09:34.280
If we can sell it all,
it'll be a nice amount.

09:34.960 --> 09:36.560
Duanwu, you're really impressive.

09:36.640 --> 09:38.960
Barely here
and you're already allowed off the ship

09:39.040 --> 09:40.280
to sell waste!

09:40.360 --> 09:42.760
This used to be something
only Mr. Cao could handle.

09:43.280 --> 09:45.080
Duanwu's amazing, of course!

09:45.160 --> 09:47.200
When she makes big money,

09:47.280 --> 09:49.600
we'll get you loads of dried meat, Loud,

09:49.680 --> 09:50.680
and medicine for your throat!

09:50.760 --> 09:54.120
Dear Hu, we'll buy you 20 dresses!

09:54.200 --> 09:55.840
Twenty?

09:57.160 --> 10:01.000
Dear Xiu, we'll get you shoes
encrusted with pearls!

10:01.520 --> 10:02.480
-Pearl shoes?
-Yeah!

10:02.560 --> 10:05.320
We're rich!

10:05.400 --> 10:06.800
-We're rich!
-What wealth?

10:08.640 --> 10:10.720
From a distance,
I could hear all of you yelling here.

10:11.240 --> 10:12.800
It's the middle of the night.

10:13.320 --> 10:15.240
Isn't there any order on the lower deck?

10:18.000 --> 10:20.320
Duanwu, not bad at all.

10:20.840 --> 10:23.760
I hear you're going to sell waste?

10:24.360 --> 10:25.280
Mr. Cao.

10:26.880 --> 10:27.880
I know

10:27.960 --> 10:31.440
you were handling this waste before,
and I appreciate your effort.

10:32.240 --> 10:34.120
This time, I'll go for you.

10:34.200 --> 10:36.640
Naturally, the money from the sale…

10:41.480 --> 10:43.640
You're overthinking. I never said that.

10:44.400 --> 10:45.920
That's your imagination.

10:46.000 --> 10:48.040
But about the money…

10:50.280 --> 10:52.560
Oh, it's late.
All of you should head to bed.

10:53.680 --> 10:54.840
Thank you, Mr. Cao.

10:57.640 --> 10:58.480
Shrimp!

11:05.400 --> 11:06.800
Cao's a greedy guy.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.840
Clean this up.

11:12.840 --> 11:14.720
You were coming to Lingnan.

11:14.800 --> 11:17.200
Why didn't you tell me beforehand?

11:17.280 --> 11:19.400
We could've traveled together.

11:19.480 --> 11:23.240
Senior Brother,
I had no idea you were in Guangzhou.

11:23.320 --> 11:25.200
If I'd known, I would've told you.

11:25.280 --> 11:26.200
-Here.
-Here.

11:34.640 --> 11:35.800
Junior Brother,

11:35.880 --> 11:39.160
why exactly did you come to Hepu?

11:39.240 --> 11:41.080
The beauty of the South Sea pearls

11:42.160 --> 11:43.920
is too tempting.

11:44.880 --> 11:47.200
So, I wanted to see Hepu for myself.

11:47.280 --> 11:50.000
But once I arrived,
do you know what I saw?

11:50.080 --> 11:53.720
Just pearl divers leaping out of the water
to escape man-eating sharks.

11:54.320 --> 11:57.720
At the pearl auction,
esteemed guests abound,

11:58.240 --> 12:01.080
yet it's built on the blood and tears
of countless pearl divers.

12:01.160 --> 12:04.440
I understand how you feel. But…

12:05.600 --> 12:07.520
the hardships of pearl diving

12:07.600 --> 12:10.480
have always been this way.

12:10.560 --> 12:12.800
We don't control that.

12:13.480 --> 12:16.400
But before, the pearls were for tributes.

12:17.040 --> 12:18.680
Now look at the Cui's Pearl Farm.

12:18.760 --> 12:22.160
They are recklessly abusing the divers,
treating lives like they're worthless.

12:22.680 --> 12:24.520
-Worse still--
-Even worse than that?

12:24.600 --> 12:28.280
Junior Brother, don't hold back.
Just say it.

12:28.360 --> 12:31.520
If what you say
about the Cui's Pearl Farm is true,

12:32.040 --> 12:34.440
I'll make sure
they don't get away with it.

12:36.880 --> 12:38.600
On the second night of the pearl auction,

12:39.480 --> 12:41.200
the Pearl Tower burned down.

12:41.800 --> 12:44.520
Peng Wu, a merchant from Chang'an,
died inside.

12:45.400 --> 12:47.080
Cui Ding fled with the funds,

12:47.760 --> 12:49.880
and his body was later found in Guangzhou.

12:49.960 --> 12:51.520
Peng Wu is dead?

12:52.040 --> 12:53.880
Cui Ding fled with the funds?

12:53.960 --> 12:57.240
The burning of Pearl Tower
has caused a huge stir in Hepu.

12:57.320 --> 12:59.600
Cui Ding's body
is still at the Guangzhou prefecture.

13:00.120 --> 13:01.040
You didn't know?

13:03.200 --> 13:05.360
I was indeed careless.

13:08.080 --> 13:12.400
Senior Brother, do you know those two?

13:13.080 --> 13:15.840
Regardless of my acquaintance,

13:16.360 --> 13:19.120
if Cui's Pearl Farm did such evils,

13:20.520 --> 13:23.000
as an upright official,

13:23.520 --> 13:26.680
I won't let them get away!

13:29.400 --> 13:33.280
Since you're involved, I can rest assured.

13:33.360 --> 13:35.360
As long as I'm here,

13:35.440 --> 13:40.760
I won't let those villains
run wild in this just world!

13:40.840 --> 13:41.720
Here.

13:42.920 --> 13:45.960
-Just leave it to me.
-This drink is for you, Senior Brother!

14:07.760 --> 14:09.800
Master, the guest has left.

14:13.920 --> 14:15.920
Do you think my junior

14:16.440 --> 14:18.520
has already set his sights on me?

14:19.400 --> 14:22.280
Master, you've always been cautious,

14:22.800 --> 14:25.200
leaving no trace.

14:25.720 --> 14:28.720
Besides, Peng Wu and Cui Ding are dead.

14:29.240 --> 14:31.880
Zhang Jinran surely won't find proof.

14:33.040 --> 14:35.480
You don't know my junior brother.

14:35.560 --> 14:37.440
Once he's set on something,

14:38.280 --> 14:40.880
he won't easily let it go.

14:40.960 --> 14:43.880
Otherwise, why would Prince Ying
send him to Hepu?

14:45.000 --> 14:46.280
Prince Ying…

14:47.640 --> 14:49.400
-Could it be over Prince Tan?
-Hey.

14:52.640 --> 14:56.560
Cutting off trade is minor,
but if we're exposed,

14:57.080 --> 15:00.200
we might meet a fate worse than Cui Ding.

15:03.400 --> 15:07.200
Master, Lady Shijiu sent an invitation,
requesting a meeting tomorrow.

15:09.280 --> 15:12.080
Why does she keep pestering?

15:12.680 --> 15:14.960
-Tell her I won't meet her!
-Yes, sir.

15:19.320 --> 15:21.880
Special Envoy Xu refused your invitation.

15:22.480 --> 15:24.760
He's eager to distance himself,

15:24.840 --> 15:26.560
not to investigate someone

15:27.120 --> 15:29.040
but afraid of being investigated.

15:31.680 --> 15:34.600
It seems we'll have to find a way
to handle the tribute pearls ourselves.

15:41.000 --> 15:44.120
Go, contact the Guangzhou banks.
Gather all available silver.

15:44.200 --> 15:47.840
Contact every jewelry shop here.
We need to buy pearls.

15:47.920 --> 15:49.560
No matter the cost,

15:49.640 --> 15:51.880
bring back every last one
they have in reserve.

15:51.960 --> 15:53.520
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

15:57.320 --> 15:58.240
Cui Jia.

16:00.920 --> 16:04.040
-Master Shijiu.
-You said at the pearl auction

16:04.600 --> 16:06.960
Zhang Jinran and Yan Zijing

16:07.480 --> 16:09.880
bid against each other
over a mere pearl diver?

16:09.960 --> 16:11.280
Indeed.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.240
Mr. Peng said

16:12.320 --> 16:14.720
Yan Zijing met Zhang Jinran on the ship.

16:14.800 --> 16:17.360
Seeing Zhang as a poor scholar, unworldly,

16:17.440 --> 16:18.400
Yan brought Zhang along.

16:19.760 --> 16:22.840
He can spend gold willow leaf
at an auction.

16:22.920 --> 16:24.640
You call him a "poor scholar"?

16:27.520 --> 16:31.120
He's the fourth son of Minister Zhang
and a companion to the Emperor.

16:32.640 --> 16:34.560
You call him a "poor scholar"?

16:41.920 --> 16:44.440
Their meeting can't be a coincidence.

16:47.040 --> 16:48.240
Investigate for me.

16:48.960 --> 16:50.880
Find out who Yan Zijing truly is.

16:51.760 --> 16:52.600
Understood.

16:58.360 --> 17:00.920
FUSHU PORT

17:01.440 --> 17:03.280
Come on. Unload the goods!

17:04.119 --> 17:05.079
Take it slow.

17:05.160 --> 17:07.520
Duanwu, should I try asking
Supervisor Kang again?

17:07.599 --> 17:09.200
I'll go with you.

17:09.280 --> 17:11.480
-You can't carry this load alone.
-No need.

17:12.440 --> 17:13.960
Don't worry. I got this.

17:15.119 --> 17:18.440
Duanwu, this batch is top quality.

17:18.520 --> 17:20.079
It might even be sold for 20 cash a jin!

17:20.160 --> 17:21.880
-We'll be rich then!
-Keep your voice down.

17:22.480 --> 17:25.880
Rich or not,
let's wait until I actually sell it.

17:26.400 --> 17:28.200
But I promise, I'll give it my best.

17:28.800 --> 17:30.560
I believe in you, Duanwu. You can do it.

17:30.640 --> 17:33.960
Shrimp, tell me,
is it really like you said?

17:34.040 --> 17:36.200
Just bring the goods
to a herbal shop door,

17:36.280 --> 17:37.400
let them inspect, and that's it?

17:38.040 --> 17:39.720
My third uncle used to do it this way.

17:40.240 --> 17:41.240
If one shop doesn't want it,
go to the next.

17:41.320 --> 17:42.720
This batch has been sold!

17:42.800 --> 17:45.080
Someone's bound to want them.

17:45.160 --> 17:48.040
Duanwu, if he can do it, so can you!

17:51.480 --> 17:52.320
I'm off.

17:54.400 --> 17:56.400
Hurry up. Keep moving!

18:00.560 --> 18:02.000
Thanks for your hard work!

18:04.000 --> 18:05.040
You can't go ashore.

18:05.120 --> 18:08.040
I know, Mr. Cao,
but I'm not on land, am I?

18:08.120 --> 18:10.840
-Look, is this shore?
-Get on the ship, you brat.

18:10.920 --> 18:13.720
Shrimp. I'll bring you some treats back!

18:13.800 --> 18:15.040
Got it, Duanwu!

18:15.120 --> 18:18.040
Safe travels, Duanwu.
May business be booming!

18:29.680 --> 18:31.120
Foolish.

18:32.760 --> 18:34.080
At least she's bold.

18:36.000 --> 18:38.400
Bold and foolish.
Do you know the consequences?

18:40.600 --> 18:41.760
A quick death.

18:41.840 --> 18:43.520
And what about a nasty one
with a sharp tongue?

18:45.560 --> 18:46.680
Then he'd live a thousand years.

18:48.640 --> 18:51.960
-We should get off too.
-What for?

18:52.040 --> 18:54.760
Every place has its own boss.

18:55.400 --> 18:57.960
We're making money on their turf.

18:58.800 --> 19:01.880
So, we should pay our respects
to the head of Guangzhou's guild.

19:06.120 --> 19:07.240
Take it slow.

19:48.640 --> 19:50.560
Take your time, sir.

19:51.080 --> 19:52.240
Take care.

19:52.760 --> 19:53.920
Pardon me.

19:54.480 --> 19:55.720
See you.

19:56.400 --> 19:57.440
Sir.

20:02.080 --> 20:03.040
Sir.

20:03.560 --> 20:05.480
I have jewelry scraps,

20:05.560 --> 20:09.360
including lapis, mica,
all available for inspection.

20:09.440 --> 20:11.680
-Take a look.
-What shop are you with?

20:11.760 --> 20:12.600
Yan's Trading Convoy.

20:12.680 --> 20:14.680
I never heard of it. Move along.

20:14.760 --> 20:17.840
Yan's Trading Convoy came from the West,

20:17.920 --> 20:20.320
and we recently bought
a large batch of pearls

20:20.400 --> 20:22.880
from Cui's in Hepu.
Our goods are guaranteed good quality.

20:22.960 --> 20:24.320
I can show you.

20:24.400 --> 20:27.160
Miss, this is a herbal shop,
and we deal in medicine.

20:27.240 --> 20:29.080
-I can't take such a risk.
-Understood.

20:29.160 --> 20:31.680
But I assure you,
our quality is top-notch.

20:31.760 --> 20:34.200
-Just take a look. You'll see.
-Even with our century-old legacy,

20:34.280 --> 20:36.400
we can't afford the risk of selling fakes.

20:36.480 --> 20:38.720
No way. How could it be fake?

20:40.880 --> 20:43.240
Give me the lowest price. I guarantee.

20:43.760 --> 20:44.960
Just give me the lowest price
you offered before.

20:45.480 --> 20:47.000
-How about it?
-Then let me ask you,

20:47.080 --> 20:49.280
once you sell this load,
where will you go?

20:53.240 --> 20:54.280
What about this? Take a look.

20:54.360 --> 20:55.680
I don't know.

20:55.760 --> 20:58.680
And if there's an issue with the goods,
who do I go to?

20:58.760 --> 20:59.600
Where would I find you?

20:59.680 --> 21:01.560
There can't be an issue, sir.

21:01.640 --> 21:03.280
-Really, see for yourself.
-Our shop already

21:03.360 --> 21:04.880
has its own suppliers.

21:04.960 --> 21:07.160
If I buy your load,

21:07.240 --> 21:09.600
when they deliver their goods,
how would I explain it?

21:09.680 --> 21:11.960
Miss, you'd better move along.

21:12.040 --> 21:13.920
Wait, sir…

21:16.680 --> 21:20.200
Leave. Hurry up!
We told you we can't do this deal.

21:20.280 --> 21:22.160
-I'll leave right away.
-Go on, quickly now.

21:25.560 --> 21:27.080
Move along. We're not doing this business.

21:27.160 --> 21:28.800
Wait…

21:30.200 --> 21:31.160
We're not doing this business. Now, leave!

21:31.240 --> 21:32.720
Move along!

21:32.800 --> 21:33.880
Honestly. Don't come back here!

21:36.160 --> 21:37.400
Sir, come on in!

21:37.480 --> 21:38.440
This way!

21:38.520 --> 21:42.680
Trinkets here. Take a look!

21:43.520 --> 21:46.760
Sachets, charms, small items here!

21:46.840 --> 21:49.080
PROSPERITY IN BUSINESS

21:49.160 --> 21:51.160
I didn't expect
the head of the jewelry guild here

21:51.240 --> 21:53.480
to be such a young master.

21:54.440 --> 21:55.280
My apologies and respects.

21:55.360 --> 21:57.840
Your Pearl Poetry Gathering
gained fame overnight.

21:57.920 --> 22:01.200
-I'm deeply impressed.
-You flatter me.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.880
Please, appraise these jewels for me.

22:21.920 --> 22:23.120
What?

22:23.680 --> 22:26.480
-Not interested in Lingnan pearls?
-Not at all.

22:27.360 --> 22:29.440
But as the head of the guild,

22:29.520 --> 22:32.640
you must know that rarity drives value.

22:32.720 --> 22:35.560
Merchants all know the more, the cheaper.

22:36.120 --> 22:39.560
Everyone hopes, of course,
to stock rare goods to sell.

22:39.640 --> 22:41.280
Lingnan pearl ornaments

22:41.800 --> 22:44.040
are famous far and wide.

22:44.120 --> 22:46.520
But over the years, imitators abound,

22:47.360 --> 22:49.680
with similar designs everywhere.

22:49.760 --> 22:51.440
To keep customers,

22:51.520 --> 22:54.320
each guild has had to lower prices.

22:54.400 --> 22:57.440
This competition is inevitable.

22:58.320 --> 23:01.480
But our craftsmanship,
especially the quality of our pearls,

23:01.560 --> 23:02.520
is top-notch.

23:03.040 --> 23:06.040
How could they compare
with mere imitators?

23:06.120 --> 23:09.840
We both know that exhausting fortunes
to battle imitators

23:10.360 --> 23:11.520
isn't sustainable.

23:12.120 --> 23:14.600
Besides,
Hepu's pearl farm is now destroyed.

23:14.680 --> 23:17.240
In three months, there'll be no supply.

23:17.760 --> 23:21.440
When that time comes,
what will you all do?

23:23.600 --> 23:25.720
Yes, what can we do then?

23:25.800 --> 23:28.280
We can't eat through our fortune.

23:32.720 --> 23:36.200
Master Yan, with your insight,
you've uncovered the truth.

23:37.200 --> 23:39.400
Please, enlighten us.

23:46.240 --> 23:50.160
These are colored stones
my master brought from the West.

23:50.240 --> 23:51.680
Please, take a look.

23:57.520 --> 23:58.520
Truly, Master Yan,

23:58.600 --> 24:00.640
these are rare treasures.

24:01.560 --> 24:03.160
I'm amazed.

24:03.240 --> 24:06.760
These here are gifts for everyone.

24:14.880 --> 24:16.800
In giving such precious gifts,

24:17.320 --> 24:21.160
I wonder, Master Yan,
what do you seek in return?

24:24.080 --> 24:25.520
I seek mutual prosperity

24:26.840 --> 24:28.160
and wealth through harmony.

24:29.960 --> 24:31.520
Within three months,

24:32.040 --> 24:33.400
I'm willing to bring
Western Regions colored stone

24:33.480 --> 24:35.240
your esteemed jewelry guild lacks

24:35.320 --> 24:36.880
into the Guangzhou's jewelry industry,

24:36.960 --> 24:39.520
becoming the first
to do colored stone business here.

24:39.600 --> 24:42.440
We'll provide the raw stones
and the techniques.

24:42.960 --> 24:44.040
Guangzhou's jewelry guild

24:44.120 --> 24:47.240
will supply artisans and manage the sales.

24:48.360 --> 24:50.600
-What's the profit split?
-Seventy-thirty.

24:50.680 --> 24:52.320
Master Yan, you drive a hard bargain.

24:54.200 --> 24:57.680
I believe you'd rather
not eat through your fortune.

24:57.760 --> 25:01.920
We can promise your guild
exclusivity in Guangzhou,

25:02.440 --> 25:05.840
supporting you as the only
Western Regions colored stone supplier.

25:14.880 --> 25:17.000
Fine, I accept your terms.

25:17.080 --> 25:18.640
But I have one more request.

25:18.720 --> 25:22.200
My mother
dearly loved Hepu's South Sea pearls.

25:22.960 --> 25:24.760
Her death anniversary is in a few days.

25:25.320 --> 25:27.280
I hope you can gather some pearls for me.

25:27.800 --> 25:30.080
Of course, only the best.

25:30.680 --> 25:33.880
Rest assured, Master Yan,
I'll get them for you.

25:34.920 --> 25:35.800
Thank you.

25:56.000 --> 25:58.240
Sir, take a look!

26:04.280 --> 26:06.520
Step right up!

26:08.640 --> 26:09.520
Where are you staying?

26:09.600 --> 26:11.120
I'll have it sent over.

26:12.240 --> 26:15.440
Sachets, charms!

26:17.880 --> 26:20.800
Miss, I've seen you pushing this cart

26:20.880 --> 26:22.600
around the streets all afternoon.

26:22.680 --> 26:24.120
Are you selling something?

26:24.200 --> 26:25.960
These are scraps from our trading convoy,

26:27.200 --> 26:29.200
including mica, lapis, all kinds.

26:29.280 --> 26:31.640
Local herbal shops won't buy
from traveling merchants.

26:31.720 --> 26:34.960
Their suppliers are all local connections.

26:35.040 --> 26:38.040
-Yes.
-It's tough to sell this way.

26:41.480 --> 26:43.880
Since you're struggling,
I can offer you some advice.

26:45.600 --> 26:48.160
I have channels to help you sell.

26:48.240 --> 26:50.520
But I'll need a commission.

26:52.160 --> 26:53.880
How much?

26:55.080 --> 26:55.920
Zhao Three,

26:56.680 --> 26:58.320
scamming people again?

26:58.400 --> 27:00.840
Oh, I just remembered.
I have something to do at home.

27:00.920 --> 27:01.960
I'll take my leave.

27:02.560 --> 27:03.800
You scoundrel!

27:05.040 --> 27:07.360
That Zhao Three
just scams outsiders for their goods.

27:08.040 --> 27:10.400
-He…
-Miss, since you're new here,

27:10.480 --> 27:12.160
-stay on your guard.
-Thank you.

27:18.000 --> 27:19.720
These are scraps from our trading convoy,

27:20.320 --> 27:23.400
meant for the herbal shops,
but the locals won't take them.

27:24.200 --> 27:26.840
Well now, how much do you have?

27:29.560 --> 27:30.560
Over here…

27:31.520 --> 27:32.360
more than 200 jin.

27:34.840 --> 27:37.440
I am the shopkeeper of Wu's Herbal Shop.

27:38.800 --> 27:41.760
By chance, we need just this batch.

27:41.840 --> 27:45.680
Meeting you is fate. Follow me.

27:47.320 --> 27:49.400
-This way.
-Okay.

27:52.720 --> 27:53.560
Where?

27:53.640 --> 27:54.720
WU'S HERBAL SHOP

27:54.800 --> 27:56.280
Goods are here!

27:58.240 --> 28:00.400
-Master Wu.
-Master Wu.

28:01.000 --> 28:04.760
Oh, Miss, what's your price?

28:08.160 --> 28:09.680
Will 25 cash a jin do?

28:09.760 --> 28:11.240
How about 23?

28:11.320 --> 28:14.120
Let's settle at 24 a jin.

28:14.760 --> 28:16.160
Everything extra goes to you.

28:16.920 --> 28:19.600
I know it's tough for you, Miss.
Deal, 24 cash.

28:19.680 --> 28:20.560
-Okay.
-Inspect the goods!

28:20.640 --> 28:21.480
-Understood!
-Got it!

28:22.760 --> 28:23.600
I'll handle it.

28:27.520 --> 28:28.720
The quality looks good.

28:31.240 --> 28:32.120
Alright.

28:40.120 --> 28:42.960
Okay. Master Wu, in total, it's 202 jin.

28:43.040 --> 28:44.320
Two jin extra?

28:44.400 --> 28:46.880
-Consider it your gift to me.
-Take it, please.

28:46.960 --> 28:48.400
Alright, unload it out back.

28:48.480 --> 28:49.320
-Yes, sir.
-Here.

28:49.840 --> 28:51.560
-I'll come back for the cart later.
-Okay.

28:55.440 --> 28:56.600
Miss.

28:57.520 --> 28:59.640
-This is…
-This is "flying cash".

28:59.720 --> 29:00.920
-"Flying cash"?
-Well,

29:01.440 --> 29:05.400
no counting house around here
carries that much cash.

29:06.760 --> 29:09.200
Just walk a bit down
to the Jie's Money House.

29:09.280 --> 29:10.880
You can exchange this "flying cash"
for cash there.

29:10.960 --> 29:12.640
-Thanks, Master Wu.
-Alright. Go quickly now.

29:12.720 --> 29:14.280
-Thank you.
-Quick, now.

29:22.280 --> 29:23.400
Sir,

29:23.480 --> 29:27.800
are there any shops around
with things kids like,

29:27.880 --> 29:29.720
treats, toys,

29:30.280 --> 29:31.800
or maybe cloth?

29:31.880 --> 29:34.680
-I see many shops here…
-This "flying cash" is fake!

29:37.560 --> 29:39.480
It was issued by Wu's Herbal Shop.

29:39.560 --> 29:41.360
It couldn't possibly be fake! Check again.

29:42.000 --> 29:44.760
See this seal? It's obviously a fake!

29:44.840 --> 29:47.040
A fake is a fake.
I don't care where you got it.

29:47.120 --> 29:48.760
You're here to scam me?

29:48.840 --> 29:50.440
-No, I'm not--
-Get lost!

29:52.680 --> 29:54.400
I'll go ask. I'll go ask.

29:54.480 --> 29:55.480
Leave!

29:57.640 --> 29:58.480
Unbelievable.

30:00.800 --> 30:02.560
WU'S HERBAL SHOP

30:02.640 --> 30:03.680
Master Wu!

30:04.600 --> 30:06.280
-Master Wu!
-What's the shouting for?

30:06.360 --> 30:08.680
Master Wu is meeting with guests.
Do you need something, Miss?

30:08.760 --> 30:10.200
I need to see Master Wu.

30:10.880 --> 30:12.440
I must see him!

30:12.520 --> 30:14.000
Let me report to him first.

30:14.080 --> 30:16.000
-Go quickly.
-Huh?

30:16.520 --> 30:20.120
-Duanwu, what are you doing here?
-Mr. Cao, I'm looking for Master Wu.

30:21.720 --> 30:23.240
Go get Master Wu!

30:23.320 --> 30:24.480
This is Master Wu.

30:24.560 --> 30:27.280
No, not this Wu.

30:27.360 --> 30:28.680
There's only one Master Wu.

30:28.760 --> 30:30.160
I've known him for years.

30:30.240 --> 30:32.560
We were just catching up this afternoon.

30:33.520 --> 30:35.960
By the way,
weren't you here to sell goods?

30:36.760 --> 30:39.280
Where are they now? Are they all sold?

30:40.520 --> 30:41.960
No, it's not this Wu.

30:42.040 --> 30:45.600
There's another Wu
who gave me this "flying cash"

30:45.680 --> 30:47.600
to exchange for cash at the bank ahead.

30:47.680 --> 30:50.360
I gave him everything,
and he took all the goods.

30:50.440 --> 30:52.680
-But it wasn't this Wu.
-Wait a moment.

30:52.760 --> 30:54.560
You must be talking about Wu Xiang.

30:54.640 --> 30:56.400
He used to deliver for us,

30:56.480 --> 30:57.960
but he's neck-deep in debt from gambling.

30:58.040 --> 30:59.400
He hasn't shown up in ages.

30:59.480 --> 31:00.560
What's going on?

31:01.080 --> 31:03.920
Today, we needed some jewelry scraps.
Wu Xiang said he had some.

31:04.000 --> 31:06.080
-That's my batch!
-Oh.

31:06.160 --> 31:08.320
He said he had goods,
so he brought them over.

31:08.400 --> 31:11.080
We checked the batch,
and the payment was settled.

31:11.160 --> 31:12.480
Payment's already gone to Wu Xiang.

31:12.560 --> 31:14.520
-But…
-Wait a second.

31:14.600 --> 31:16.640
-Take me to Wu Xiang!
-Hold on!

31:17.520 --> 31:20.320
Are you saying you lost the goods?

31:20.400 --> 31:21.280
Those weren't yours.

31:21.360 --> 31:23.320
-They belonged to the convoy!
-I know!

31:23.400 --> 31:26.200
Do you realize how long it took to gather

31:26.280 --> 31:27.480
that 202 jin of scraps?

31:27.560 --> 31:29.880
If I were handling this,
it'd be done by now.

31:29.960 --> 31:32.880
-But you messed up your very first deal--
-How did you know it was 202 jin?

31:35.720 --> 31:38.240
Mr. Cao, how do you know
it was exactly 202 jin?

31:38.320 --> 31:39.440
Enough with the questions.

31:39.520 --> 31:40.720
You lost the goods.
There's punishment for that.

31:40.800 --> 31:42.280
-Take her away!
-Mr. Cao…

31:42.800 --> 31:45.360
Mr. Cao… How did you know it was 202 jin?

31:45.440 --> 31:48.680
You set me up! Mr. Cao!

32:04.040 --> 32:06.400
Master, the ten lashes are done!

32:06.960 --> 32:08.720
Giving up greater profit for small gains,

32:08.800 --> 32:11.000
blind confidence,
and trusting others too easily.

32:11.520 --> 32:12.760
Those are grave errors in business!

32:13.600 --> 32:16.200
Starting now,
you're back to the lower deck.

32:16.720 --> 32:17.880
Continue as a slave.

32:17.960 --> 32:20.640
A nobody deserves only to be trampled.

32:37.200 --> 32:38.320
Master,

32:39.520 --> 32:41.040
may I have a chance to redeem myself?

32:42.200 --> 32:43.040
Still unwilling to yield?

32:43.120 --> 32:45.440
Please, Master, give me one chance.

32:49.040 --> 32:50.320
And if you fail again?

32:51.840 --> 32:55.080
If I fail, you may do as you wish.

32:59.400 --> 33:00.240
Fine.

33:05.040 --> 33:08.040
Complete your task by tomorrow afternoon.

33:50.200 --> 33:51.240
What are you going to do?

33:53.480 --> 33:54.720
Where's Wu Xiang?

33:55.480 --> 33:57.440
What are you talking about? I don't know…

33:57.520 --> 33:59.880
Where's Wu Xiang?

34:00.520 --> 34:01.920
I'll tell you, Mr. Cao,

34:02.760 --> 34:04.280
if I fail, I'll die for it.

34:04.800 --> 34:06.640
And before I die,
I'll take someone with me.

34:11.000 --> 34:12.280
I'll tell you…

34:14.520 --> 34:17.639
He's at… the Sanqi Garden.

34:36.960 --> 34:40.080
SANQI GARDEN

34:45.679 --> 34:49.360
What a foolish girl.

35:09.000 --> 35:10.240
You…

35:19.520 --> 35:21.240
Stop…

35:21.320 --> 35:23.200
Are you Wu Xiang or Master Wu?

35:23.800 --> 35:25.560
-Xiang.
-Where are my scraps?

35:26.160 --> 35:27.200
Sold.

35:28.560 --> 35:29.440
Where's the money?

35:30.040 --> 35:31.960
I… lost it all.

35:34.240 --> 35:35.440
Don't…

35:35.960 --> 35:37.760
I have it…

35:45.600 --> 35:48.480
I sold them for 4,000 cash.
The money is all here.

36:00.200 --> 36:01.840
My goodness…

36:23.600 --> 36:24.680
Are you here looking for me?

36:24.760 --> 36:26.520
-Assistant Pang.
-This is…

36:26.600 --> 36:28.480
Two hundred jin of scraps.
As previously agreed,

36:28.560 --> 36:29.960
I bought them from you at 16 cash a jin.

36:30.480 --> 36:33.720
-They were sold for 4,000 cash.
-You actually brought the money back.

36:34.400 --> 36:37.120
This little slave is truly something!

36:40.200 --> 36:42.880
-Four thousand cash…
-Here are 3,200 cash.

36:43.400 --> 36:45.080
I'll take the excess. It's my share.

36:46.400 --> 36:49.280
You got the accounting all sorted out.
You've got potential!

37:06.080 --> 37:07.560
What's wrong? We got it wrong?

37:09.320 --> 37:11.560
No. Assistant Pang's figures

37:12.120 --> 37:13.320
can't be off.

37:16.040 --> 37:17.960
They let a sure thing slip away!

37:26.640 --> 37:28.120
Move it along.

37:28.200 --> 37:30.160
You're slow as molasses!

37:34.920 --> 37:36.200
I got the money back.

37:39.720 --> 37:41.520
Wu Xiang's tied up at Sanqi Garden.

37:44.600 --> 37:46.040
Want me to bring him in?

37:49.160 --> 37:50.560
What you said before…

37:53.280 --> 37:54.720
My words count more than yours.

37:56.520 --> 37:58.320
But I'm just a small slave.

37:59.080 --> 38:00.720
I'll still need Mr. Cao's guidance

38:01.640 --> 38:03.000
here on the ship.

38:05.880 --> 38:08.720
-Name your terms.
-Letting slaves ashore.

38:10.600 --> 38:11.560
Absurd…

38:13.040 --> 38:14.680
Do you know how many slaves
are on this ship?

38:14.760 --> 38:17.400
If they were all ashore,
the Master would have my head.

38:17.480 --> 38:20.320
Seventy-eight slaves on board,
divided into three shifts.

38:20.840 --> 38:23.840
Registered each time they get off
and watch one another.

38:25.240 --> 38:28.160
The Master is merciful.
He provides good food and shelter.

38:28.680 --> 38:30.760
The slaves outside
have no papers, no means to survive.

38:30.840 --> 38:32.000
Why wouldn't they return?

38:32.880 --> 38:34.640
You're thorough in your planning.

38:38.680 --> 38:39.720
Your choice.

38:40.760 --> 38:44.280
But remember,
after all that scheming to rise up,

38:45.400 --> 38:47.400
don't let Wu Xiang trip you up.

38:48.480 --> 38:49.360
I…

39:14.640 --> 39:15.800
Dad,

39:16.360 --> 39:19.480
when will we reach the State of Kang?

39:20.960 --> 39:22.160
First by water,

39:22.240 --> 39:24.840
then by land, still a long way to go.

39:24.920 --> 39:28.240
Mom, when will we return to Yangzhou?

39:28.320 --> 39:30.120
Likely in October.

39:30.200 --> 39:33.640
By then,
my little sister will have grown up.

39:33.720 --> 39:34.720
That's right.

39:34.800 --> 39:37.040
Then, from then on,
we can bring her with us wherever we go.

39:37.760 --> 39:39.000
Of course.

39:39.080 --> 39:41.160
From then on, she'll be always with us.

39:41.240 --> 39:43.440
Our family will always stay together.

41:05.400 --> 41:06.600
Master,

41:06.680 --> 41:08.160
I've gotten the money.

41:08.240 --> 41:10.320
Tomorrow, report to Accountant Wei
for punishment.

41:10.840 --> 41:12.920
This month, half of your wages are cut.

41:14.080 --> 41:16.160
I took the lashes,
and I got the money back.

41:16.240 --> 41:17.160
Why still take punishment?

41:17.240 --> 41:19.880
You broke the rules.
Shouldn't you be punished?

41:19.960 --> 41:21.880
But I was set up.

41:29.200 --> 41:30.400
You already knew that?

41:31.200 --> 41:32.360
So what?

41:37.120 --> 41:38.680
Is there fairness in Yan's Trading Convoy?

41:38.760 --> 41:42.240
This began with you taking
Mr. Cao's business by force.

41:42.760 --> 41:45.120
Besides, your recklessness

41:45.200 --> 41:47.400
nearly hurt the convoy.

41:47.480 --> 41:49.760
Are you not at fault?
Shouldn't you be punished?

41:50.280 --> 41:52.040
So, for Mr. Cao,

41:52.560 --> 41:55.040
he's neither punished nor scolded?

41:55.560 --> 41:56.640
We just let it slide?

41:56.720 --> 41:58.520
In Yan's Trading Convoy, the rule is,

41:58.600 --> 42:00.720
everyone does their duty,
and everything serves its purpose.

42:01.280 --> 42:03.280
Mr. Cao may be vile,

42:03.360 --> 42:06.760
but if he gets his job done, I'll use him.

42:08.400 --> 42:11.840
And as for fairness, if you want it,

42:12.360 --> 42:14.640
you'd better start thinking

42:14.720 --> 42:16.800
about making yourself useful.

42:17.320 --> 42:20.280
Then, you'll have the right
to talk about fairness.

42:21.040 --> 42:24.440
This is the rule of the world.

42:37.800 --> 42:39.200
Everything serves its purpose,

42:40.640 --> 42:42.200
and everyone does their duty…
